    {
      "text": "Stir in the garlic, cumin and paprika for 1 minute.",
      "uses": ["garlic", "cumin", "paprika"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the lentils, tomatoes and broth. Bring to a boil, then lower the heat and simmer, partly covered, until the lentils are tender, about 25 minutes.",
